      "content": "I appreciate that. but I don't know what I'm supposed to do with this. like... what's the point. my son is gone. my parents are gone. those pictures were the last real proof that any of them existed in my life. now even that's gone. I feel like I have no reason to hold on to this life anymore. everything that mattered to me has burned",
